  "atomic_questions": [
    "Regarding the \"at least one type C\" requirement for containers that contain type A — is exactly one unit of C sufficient to satisfy this rule, or is there a minimum number of C units required in a container that contains A?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question about the minimum quantity of type C required, presenting a binary choice (exactly one vs. a higher minimum) that constitutes one independent query."
}

